# The cmapc pipeline itself, as a layered flowchart with layout constraints.
title "How cmapc compiles a diagram"
layout layered dir=down
page a3
font 7pt..40pt wrap=16em

style stage color=#1565C0
style check color=#C62828

node src "Source .cmap" .stage
| one statement per line
| comments and quoted strings are accepted
node lex "Lexer" .stage
| tokens with byte spans
| newlines delimit statements
node parse "Parser" .stage
| recursive descent
| skips a bad line, keeps going
node sema "Semantic analysis" .stage
| names, styles, units
| ordering cycles (E0008)
| two passes allow forward references
node plan "Strategy" .stage
| radial or layered candidates
| real font metrics determine box sizes
node csp "CSP search"
| FC-CBJ, binary search on font
| candidate positions satisfy hard constraints
node bnb "Branch and bound"
| soft `prefer` constraints
| compares layouts at the best readable font
node core "QuickXplain"
| minimal unsat core (E0110)
| isolates a conflicting subset of `require`s
node checker "Checker" .check
| recomputes every constraint
| overlap, crossings, clipping, and overflow
node emit "SVG / TikZ"
| absolute positions; no downstream reflow
node measure "Text measurement" .stage
| font files are shared by layout and rendering
| wrapping changes node geometry
node quality "Layout polish" .stage
| annealing reduces crossings and edge clutter
| never violates a hard constraint
node diagnostics "Diagnostics" .check
| source spans point to the failing statement
| explain CODE prints the long form
node output "Rendered output" .stage
| SVG is page-sized; PNG is cropped
| TikZ preserves absolute coordinates
node failure "Failure paths" .check
| parse errors are reported and skipped
| unsatisfiable requirements stop output

src -> lex
lex -> parse
parse -> sema
sema -> plan
plan -> measure
measure -> quality
plan -> csp
csp -> bnb, core
quality -> csp
bnb -> checker
checker -> diagnostics
diagnostics -> emit
emit -> output
core ..> sema "points back at source"
failure ..> diagnostics "reported"

require bnb left-of core
require align row(bnb, core)
prefer checker near bnb weight=2
prefer emit at bottom-right
prefer diagnostics near checker within=14em weight=2
